```
* <pre>{@code
 * public enum Color {
 *     RED, GREEN, BLUE;
 * }
 * public static final Setting<Color> MY_BOOLEAN =
 *     new Setting<>("my.color.setting", Color.RED.toString(), Color::valueOf, SettingsProperty.NodeScope);
 * }
 * </pre>
```

This example does not make sense anymore (actually it didn't before because the setting name suggests a bool setting, and the snippet doesn't compile)
However, I was not sure what to replace it with. All suggestions are welcome!

